# The StylizedKitchen pack is a whole Unreal Engine project. Unity cannot read its .uasset/.umap
# files or Unreal's caches and config (see Assets/Editor/KitchenMaterialBuilder.cs), and they are
# ~960 MB of the repository. Only the FBX meshes, TGA textures and the Unity-made Materials/Shaders
# are used. Their .meta files go too, so a fresh clone has no orphaned metas.
Assets/models/env/**/*.uasset
Assets/models/env/**/*.uasset.meta
Assets/models/env/**/*.umap
Assets/models/env/**/*.umap.meta
Assets/models/env/StylizedKitchen.uproject
Assets/models/env/StylizedKitchen.uproject.meta
Assets/models/env/Intermediate/
Assets/models/env/Intermediate.meta
Assets/models/env/DerivedDataCache/
Assets/models/env/DerivedDataCache.meta
Assets/models/env/Config/
Assets/models/env/Config.meta
